LRC14 RAMANUJAN/DIVISOR QUOTIENT GUARDRAIL AUDIT
========================================================================
External seed facts used:
- sigma_k is multiplicative and is Id * 1 under Dirichlet convolution.
- Ramanujan c_q(n) is the primitive q-th root trace and has a Mobius/gcd formula.
- sigma_k(n) has a Ramanujan-sum expansion, so scalar divisor data hides phase packets.

Rows audited: 2694 (10 named + one-swap AP bank through add<=220)
Proof-route counts: {boundary-zero:2, qdiv=10:open:186, qdiv=11:open:188, qdiv=12:open:146, qdiv=12:small<=1/100:44, qdiv=13:open:192, qdiv=14:open:1065, qdiv=14:small<=1/100:212, qdiv=14:tiny<=1/1260:1, qdiv=7:open:177, qdiv=8:open:181, qdiv=9:open:184, qdiv>14:open:99, qdiv>14:small<=1/100:17}

